Replace this axios instance with a data-client base endpoint class in src/lib/api-client.ts, keeping its behavior. Other files will import it as `ApiEndpoint`; leave the endpoint definitions for later.

```ts
import Axios, { InternalAxiosRequestConfig } from 'axios';
import { env } from '@/config/env';

function authRequestInterceptor(config: InternalAxiosRequestConfig) {
  if (config.headers) {
    config.headers.Accept = 'application/json';
  }
  config.withCredentials = true;
  return config;
}

export const api = Axios.create({ baseURL: env.API_URL });
api.interceptors.request.use(authRequestInterceptor);
```

The app later calls `api.patch('/users/profile', data)` and `api.post('/discussions', data)` through it.
